<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Granite firms Kelgran, Kudu in talks.</title>
<headline>Granite firms Kelgran, Kudu in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African granite producers Kelgran Ltd and Kudu Granite Ltd said in a joint statement on Tuesday that their controlling shareholders were in negotiations which may effect the share prices of the two firms.</p>
<p>The firms advised shareholders to exercise caution when dealing in their shares until a further announcement is made</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom + 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
